**Project:** Bakery Foods Inc. | **Build:** November 9–12, 2026 | **Demo:** November 13

| Day | Focus | Key tasks | Deliverable |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Day 1 — Nov 9** ✅ | Business case, architecture & API research | Defined business case, architecture, AI evaluation strategy, n8n blueprint and README. Investigated EU cereals API (HTTP 500) and identified downloadable French wheat prices. | Documentation and initial data-source assessment |
