## MVP acceptance criteria

- One complete research-to-report workflow.
- Three working external tool/API integrations.
- PostgreSQL-based structured data retrieval and document RAG.
- Deterministic financial calculations.
- Two sample reports with evidence and explicit assumptions.
- Tested handling of API failures, missing data and invalid outputs.
- Functional n8n trigger and report delivery.

## Scope control

**Priority:** A reliable sunflower oil workflow first, then wheat.

**Optional:** MCP integration and offline LLM-as-a-Judge, only after core functionality works.

If time is limited, generate two reports using different scenarios rather than implementing a second ingredient poorly. Defer advanced monitoring, continuous alerts and production infrastructure.

**Friday, November 13:** Final demonstration, including one successful assessment and one controlled failure scenario.